    "background_story": "Arturo was a renowned botanist who spent his life studying the world's most exotic plant species. Growing up in a small village surrounded by dense rainforests, he developed a deep appreciation for the lush vegetation that thrived in these environments. As he traveled the globe, Arturo discovered new species and developed innovative methods for preserving and cultivating them. His most notable achievement was the creation of a stunning botanical garden, where he brought together the rarest and most vibrant plants from around the world. The garden, aptly named 'El Jard\u00edn de las Maravillas' (The Garden of Wonders), became a haven for nature lovers and a testament to Arturo's passion for the lush, green world that had captivated him since childhood.",
